    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/b2e7f3d6def4aae605b5c6084fdafe3d.poster.avif?t=1724196156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/b2e7f3d6def4aae605b5c6084fdafe3d.webm?t=1724196156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/b2e7f3d6def4aae605b5c6084fdafe3d.mp4?t=1724196156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge your logical skills with 35 unique and captivating challenges, while enjoying relaxing sound effects and having fun with challenging puzzles in a minimalist and relaxing experience - all you need is a mouse to play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/3f4d33fe7b192fe51f2b79e1c1b1a74d.poster.avif?t=1724196156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/3f4d33fe7b192fe51f2b79e1c1b1a74d.webm?t=1724196156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/3f4d33fe7b192fe51f2b79e1c1b1a74d.mp4?t=1724196156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>35 unique islands.<br></li><li>Satisfying and relaxing sound effects.<br></li><li>Unique puzzles.<br></li><li>Play with just a mouse.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/6b8e93b182e54375431c253daefae7fb.poster.avif?t=1724196156\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2301210/extras/6b8e93b182e54375431c253daefae7fb